    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061214.0206\n\nDOHA, Dec 14 , 2006, 2006\n\nChina's Li Yan wins Asiad cycling points gold\n\n\n\n\nChina's Li Yan won the Asian Games women's cycling points gold medal on Thursday.\n\nSouth Korea's Lee Min Hye took silver with Nontasin Chanpeng of Thailand winning bronze.",
